%SIXMD 1
# @?STAT - PRINT FILE STATUS

## @?OPERANDS

### @?PATH ...
ONE OR MORE FILESYSTEM OBJECTS TO EXAMINE.

## DESCRIPTION

STAT PRINTS TYPE, SIZE IN WORDS, MODE, UID, GID, AND MTIME36 FOR EACH PATH.
USAGE IS 'STAT PATH ...'.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
